CMD="codex"
MARKER="Ask Codex"
VERSION_CMD="codex --version"
BUNDLE='du -sb $(npm root -g)/@openai/codex | cut -f1'
NOTE="npm -g install pinned to @openai/codex@0.154.0 on NodeSource Node 22; node is counted in the install size, the npm package (with the vendored native codex, codex-code-mode-host and rg binaries for this platform) as the bundle. The process tree is a node wrapper in front of the native binary, which is not there when Codex is installed from its GitHub release or Homebrew. Provider on 127.0.0.1:9, /work trusted, update check, analytics and plugin marketplace sync off in config.toml."
